#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.rst:2
msgid "nanamin"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:1
msgid ""
"Compute the minimum of tensor elements along specified dimensions, "
"ignoring NaN values."
msgstr "NaN値を無視して、指定された次元に沿ってテンソル要素の最小値を計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:4
msgid ""
"This function calculates the minimum of all valid (non-NaN) elements in a"
" tensor along the specified dimension(s). Unlike :func:`nanmin`, this "
"function supports multiple dimensions but does not return indices. When "
"no valid elements are found along a dimension, the result is NaN."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、指定された次元に沿って、テンソル内のすべての有効な（NaNでない）要素の最小値を計算します。:func:`nanmin` "
"と異なり、この関数は複数の次元をサポートしますが、インデックスは返しません。次元に沿って有効な要素が1つも存在しない場合、結果はNaNとなります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:9
msgid "The NaN-aware minimum is computed as:"
msgstr "NaNを考慮した最小値は次のように計算されます:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:11
msgid ""
"\\text{nanamin}(X) = \\min_{i \\text{ valid}} X_i\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\text{nanamin}(X) = \\min_{i \\text{ valid}} X_i\n"
"\n"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:14
msgid "where the minimum is over all valid (non-NaN) values."
msgstr "ここで、最小値はすべての有効な（NaNでない）値に対して計算されます。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:17
msgid "The input tensor containing values."
msgstr "値を含む入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:20
msgid ""
"The dimension(s) along which to compute the minimum. If None (default), "
"the minimum is computed over all dimensions."
msgstr "最小値を計算する次元（複数可）。None（デフォルト）の場合、すべての次元にわたって最小値が計算されます。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:24
msgid ""
"Whether the output tensor has :attr:`dim` retained or not. Default is "
"False."
msgstr "出力テンソルが :attr:`dim` を保持するかどうか。デフォルトは False です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:28
msgid ""
"The minimum values computed only over valid (non-NaN) values. When no "
"valid values exist along a dimension, the result is NaN. The shape "
"depends on the input dimensions, :attr:`dim`, and :attr:`keepdim` "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"有効な（NaNでない）値のみに対して計算された最小値。次元に沿って有効な値が存在しない場合、結果はNaNとなります。形状は入力の次元、:attr:`dim`"
" および :attr:`keepdim` パラメータに依存します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:35
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:37
msgid ""
">>> # Simple minimum with NaN values\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0, nan, 4.0, 5.0])\n"
">>> QF.nanamin(x)\n"
"tensor(1.)"
msgstr ">>> # NaN値を含む単純な最小値\n>>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0, nan, 4.0, 5.0])\n>>> QF.nanamin(x)\ntensor(1.)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:42
msgid ""
">>> # All NaN returns NaN\n"
">>> all_nan = torch.tensor([nan, nan, nan])\n"
">>> QF.nanamin(all_nan)\n"
"tensor(nan)"
msgstr ">>> # すべてNaNの場合はNaNを返す\n>>> all_nan = torch.tensor([nan, nan, nan])\n>>> QF.nanamin(all_nan)\ntensor(nan)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:47
msgid ""
">>> # 2D tensor with min along columns\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, nan, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [4.0, 5.0, nan]])\n"
">>> QF.nanamin(x, dim=0)\n"
"tensor([1., 5., 3.])"
msgstr ">>> # 2次元テンソルの列方向の最小値\n>>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, nan, 3.0],\n...                   [4.0, 5.0, nan]])\n>>> QF.nanamin(x, dim=0)\ntensor([1., 5., 3.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:53
msgid ""
">>> # Min along rows\n"
">>> QF.nanamin(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([1., 4.])"
msgstr ">>> # 行方向の最小値\n>>> QF.nanamin(x, dim=1)\ntensor([1., 4.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:57
msgid ""
">>> # Multiple dimensions\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[[1.0, nan], [3.0, 4.0]],\n"
"...                   [[nan, 6.0], [7.0, nan]]])\n"
">>> QF.nanamin(x, dim=(1, 2))\n"
"tensor([1., 6.])"
msgstr ">>> # 複数の次元\n>>> x = torch.tensor([[[1.0, nan], [3.0, 4.0]],\n...                   [[nan, 6.0], [7.0, nan]]])\n>>> QF.nanamin(x, dim=(1, 2))\ntensor([1., 6.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:63
msgid ""
">>> # With keepdim\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, nan, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [4.0, 5.0, nan]])\n"
">>> QF.nanamin(x, dim=1, keepdim=True)\n"
"tensor([[1.],\n"
"        [4.]])"
msgstr ">>> # keepdim を使用\n>>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, nan, 3.0],\n...                   [4.0, 5.0, nan]])\n>>> QF.nanamin(x, dim=1, keepdim=True)\ntensor([[1.],\n        [4.]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:70
msgid ""
">>> # All NaN slice returns NaN\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0],\n"
"...                   [nan, nan]])\n"
">>> QF.nanamin(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([1., nan])"
msgstr ">>> # すべてNaNのスライスはNaNを返す\n>>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0],\n...                   [nan, nan]])\n>>> QF.nanamin(x, dim=1)\ntensor([1., nan])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:76
msgid ""
">>> # With positive infinity\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, inf, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [nan, 2.0, inf]])\n"
">>> QF.nanamin(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([1., 2.])"
msgstr ">>> # 正の無限大を含む\n>>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, inf, 3.0],\n...                   [nan, 2.0, inf]])\n>>> QF.nanamin(x, dim=1)\ntensor([1., 2.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:82
msgid ":func:`nanmin`: NaN-aware minimum with indices (single dimension only)."
msgstr ":func:`nanmin`: インデックスも返すNaN対応の最小値（単一次元のみ）。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:84
msgid ":func:`nanamax`: NaN-aware maximum over multiple dimensions."
msgstr ":func:`nanamax`: 複数次元に対応したNaN対応の最大値。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamin.nanamin:85
msgid ""
"``torch.amin``: Standard minimum over multiple dimensions (NaN "
"propagates)."
msgstr "``torch.amin``: 複数次元に対応した標準の最小値（NaNは伝播します）。"

